## ENDPOINT:The URL an API is accessed from
## CALL: A request made to an API
##API: Application Programming Interface
## Response: What the API returns when a call is made
## JSON: Javascript Object Notation
## Entity: Row in a Table behind an PAI


## POST:To Add New Information
## GET:To Pull Information
## PUT:To Update a Whole Entity
## PATCH:To Update Part of an Entity
## DELETE:To Remove An Entity